{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止持．作持．止犯．作犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聽作者，如二房等戒；制作者，如半月說戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為殘作訶責，指下篇為餘。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "相似\n謂同一篇罪也。從此生者，謂為摩觸訶責，而與女屏坐。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂犯提被\n治，後更犯殘等。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "據唯識論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼受淨者言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受淨者又言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如坐食時，前境堪足，忽低頭取與，後\n分離狀之例，名捨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "且受四藥，不加四法過中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禾愛食，或共宿，犯吉；不宿，不犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今日受食，安界\n外，不共宿，非內宿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "恃其無用，故不自竄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不任作役。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "役則\n不與，賜則受之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並疏文也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音昨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音由"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法得得本\n法，即是大得；得大得時，其得即小。法之得故，得之得故，皆依主釋。大得力強，成就二種；小得力劣，唯成一\n種。故一剎那三法中，大得二，小得一也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初念三種，望第二念中起三大得，得前三法；起三小得，得三大得，故成六\n法。第三念中通望前二，謂初念三法、第二六法，總成九法。今第三念起九大得，得前法；起九小得，得九\n大得，故成十八也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然初念善心三法俱起者，\n唯說善心，不說相應。第二六法者，唯說第二念起得得初，不說第二自所起者。善心亦有三法，謂善心及大\n得、小得，并此第二念六法，便成九法。第三念等准此說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂本法為一，此上有四大小相，并前成九，同一大得\n得之。此大得上復有九，謂大得及四大小相，此九即以得得之。其小得上又九，謂小得及大小相，此用大\n得得之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上注大小四相者，大則四本，小則四隨，詳解如論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性執"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "推撿入空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本自二空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五陰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "修德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "化他"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "推撿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即發初住"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "修德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性德也。一\n句之中，文略義廣，下去準之"}
