{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身、口、意惡，現生後報，\n自作教他，見作隨喜。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欲、色、無色界繫，助貪、助嗔、助癡之三。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上正文"}
